sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant BS as BookingService
  participant DB as H2
  C->>BS: POST /api/v1/bookings/{pnr}/cancel
  Note over BS,DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
  BS->>DB: find flight_instance_id by PNR (404 if absent)
  BS->>DB: SELECT flight_instance ... FOR UPDATE
  BS->>DB: load booking + seats
  alt already CANCELLED or flight departed
    BS-->>C: 409 Conflict
  else
    BS->>DB: status=CANCELLED, active_seat_label=NULL for each seat
    BS-->>C: 200 OK (commit) - seats bookable again
  end
